				<text><![CDATA[Nama]]></text>
			</staticText>
			<staticText>
				<reportElement x="70" y="2" width="463" height="24" uuid="e1527d5a-0b02-415c-b994-4071043c7341">
					<property name="com.jaspersoft.studio.unit.height" value="px"/>
				</reportElement>
				<textElement textAlignment="Justified" verticalAlignment="Top">
					<font fontName="Tahoma" size="9" isItalic="true"/>
					<paragraph lineSpacing="Single"/>
				</textElement>
				<text><![CDATA[If I do not give consent, or later revoke my consent to release my medical confidentiality to the insurance company that I specify, then I personally responsible for paying all services and medical treatment in Windu Husada Hospital.]]></text>
			</staticText>
			<staticText>
				<reportElement x="70" y="25" width="463" height="35" uuid="89a36148-d8ef-464b-be50-bc2300c05215">
					<property name="com.jaspersoft.studio.unit.height" value="px"/>
				</reportElement>
				<textElement textAlignment="Justified" verticalAlignment="Top">
					<font fontName="Tahoma" size="9"/>
					<paragraph lineSpacing="Single"/>
				</textElement>
				<text><![CDATA[Apabila rumah sakit membutuhkan proses hukum untuk menagih biaya pelayanan rumah sakit dari saya, saya memahami bahwa saya bertanggung jawab untuk membayar semua biaya yang disebabkan dari proses hukum tersebut.]]></text>
			</staticText>
			<staticText>
				<reportElement x="70" y="59" width="463" height="24" uuid="9956c05d-faa7-4f3c-b3c6-0f4c89535c07">
					<property name="com.jaspersoft.studio.unit.height" value="px"/>
				</reportElement>
				<textElement textAlignment="Justified" verticalAlignment="Top">
					<font fontName="Tahoma" size="9" isItalic="true"/>
					<paragraph lineSpacing="Single"/>
				</textElement>
				<text><![CDATA[If the hospital requires a legal process to charge a service charge of my hospital service, I understand that I am responsible for paying all costs resulting from the legal process.]]></text>
			</staticText>
			<staticText>
				<reportElement x="55" y="87" width="478" height="57" uuid="405424bb-c945-421e-879a-0884726ebe48">
					<property name="com.jaspersoft.studio.unit.height" value="px"/>
				</reportElement>
				<textElement textAlignment="Justified" verticalAlignment="Top">
					<font fontName="Tahoma" size="9"/>
					<paragraph lineSpacing="Single"/>
				</textElement>
				<text><![CDATA[PENGURUSAN / PENJAMINAN BPJS KESEHATAN. Telah diberikan edukasi/informasi dari petugas rumah sakit terkait pengurusan/penjaminan BPJS Kesehatan terhadap pelayanan yang akan didapatkan selama berada di rumah sakit dan diberikan kesempatan untuk bertanya atau berdiskusi, serta diberikan waktu selambat- lambatnya 3x24 Jam hari kerja sejak yang bersangkutan (pasien) dirawat atau sebelum pasien pulang/meninggal/dirujuk (bila pasien dirawat kurang dari 3 hari). Sehingga saya memahami dan mengerti bahwa :]]></text>
			</staticText>
			<staticText>
				<reportElement x="55" y="143" width="478" height="61" uuid="b479baa1-ba63-4dee-ae48-70ebceadd692">
					<property name="com.jaspersoft.studio.unit.height" value="px"/>
				</reportElement>
				<textElement textAlignment="Justified" verticalAlignment="Top">
					<font fontName="Tahoma" size="9" isItalic="true"/>
					<paragraph lineSpacing="Single"/>
				</textElement>
				<text><![CDATA[BPJS HEALTH INSURANCE ADMINISTRATION / COVERAGE GUARANTEE. Education/information has been provided by the hospital staff regarding the administration/coverage of BPJS Health for the services that will be received during hospitalization, and the patient (or family) has been given the opportunity to ask questions or discuss, as well as a maximum period of 3x24 working hours since the patient is admitted, or before the patient is discharged/passes away/referred (if the hospitalization lasts less than 3 days). Therefore, I understand and acknowledge that :]]></text>
			</staticText>
			<staticText>
				<reportElement x="55" y="320" width="478" height="30" uuid="9492e5b0-a0a1-4e90-bc7b-10a846050288">
					<property name="com.jaspersoft.studio.unit.height" value="px"/>
				</reportElement>
				<textElement textAlignment="Justified" verticalAlignment="Top">
					<font fontName="Tahoma" size="9"/>
					<paragraph lineSpacing="Single"/>
				</textElement>
				<text><![CDATA[SAYA TELAH MEMBACA dan SEPENUHNYA SETUJU dengan setiap pernyataan yang terdapat pada formulir ini dan menandatangani tanpa paksaan dan dengan kesadaran penuh.]]></text>
			</staticText>
			<staticText>
				<reportElement x="55" y="343" width="478" height="27" uuid="63763b21-3b64-4ef5-a2c9-c391a606a1e9">
					<property name="com.jaspersoft.studio.unit.height" value="px"/>
				</reportElement>
				<textElement textAlignment="Justified" verticalAlignment="Top">
					<font fontName="Tahoma" size="9" isItalic="true"/>
					<paragraph lineSpacing="Single"/>
				</textElement>
				<text><![CDATA[I HAVE READ and FULLY AGREE with any statement contained in this form and signed without coercion and with full awareness.]]></text>
			</staticText>
			<staticText>
				<reportElement x="70" y="212" width="463" height="21" uuid="716cbff3-393e-4c04-9c06-0cb2fef62cac">
					<property name="com.jaspersoft.studio.unit.height" value="px"/>
				</reportElement>
				<textElement textAlignment="Justified" verticalAlignment="Top">
					<font fontName="Tahoma" size="9" isItalic="true"/>
					<paragraph lineSpacing="Single"/>
				</textElement>
				<text><![CDATA[The guarantor cannot be changed during the course of treatment.]]></text>
			</staticText>
			<staticText>
				<reportElement x="70" y="199" width="463" height="15" uuid="a4d5a2f9-f92c-4b72-aac7-da4ecb3fb94d">
					<property name="com.jaspersoft.studio.unit.height" value="px"/>
				</reportElement>
				<textElement textAlignment="Justified" verticalAlignment="Top">
					<font fontName="Tahoma" size="9"/>
					<paragraph lineSpacing="Single"/>
				</textElement>
				<text><![CDATA[Penjaminan tidak dapat berubah di tengah perawatan.]]></text>
			</staticText>
			<staticText>
				<reportElement x="70" y="238" width="463" height="26" uuid="a0b373ec-d0ca-41d3-9c2c-65ed330564fe">
					<property name="com.jaspersoft.studio.unit.height" value="px"/>
				</reportElement>
				<textElement textAlignment="Justified" verticalAlignment="Top">
					<font fontName="Tahoma" size="9" isItalic="true"/>
					<paragraph lineSpacing="Single"/>
				</textElement>
				<text><![CDATA[There will be no additional charges if the treatment is in accordance with medical indications and covered by BPJS Health Insurance.]]></text>
			</staticText>
			<staticText>
				<reportElement x="70" y="225" width="463" height="15" uuid="1bb14ea5-25e5-4b90-9c05-31c2c7b26280">
					<property name="com.jaspersoft.studio.unit.height" value="px"/>
				</reportElement>
				<textElement textAlignment="Justified" verticalAlignment="Top">
					<font fontName="Tahoma" size="9"/>
					<paragraph lineSpacing="Single"/>
				</textElement>
				<text><![CDATA[Tidak adanya iur biaya apabila sesuai indikasi medis menggunakan Jaminan BPJS Kesehatan]]></text>
			</staticText>
			<staticText>
				<reportElement x="70" y="275" width="463" height="19" uuid="623d2561-a9a7-4049-af66-b49495ece64e">
					<property name="com.jaspersoft.studio.unit.height" value="px"/>
				</reportElement>
				<textElement textAlignment="Justified" verticalAlignment="Top">
					<font fontName="Tahoma" size="9" isItalic="true"/>
					<paragraph lineSpacing="Single"/>
				</textElement>
				<text><![CDATA[The patient/family has received education/information regarding discharge against medical advice (DAMA/APS).]]></text>
			</staticText>
			<staticText>
				<reportElement x="70" y="262" width="463" height="15" uuid="0632fdd6-ee4b-4e7a-bb00-1c5c560bdc98">
					<property name="com.jaspersoft.studio.unit.height" value="px"/>
				</reportElement>
				<textElement textAlignment="Justified" verticalAlignment="Top">
					<font fontName="Tahoma" size="9"/>
					<paragraph lineSpacing="Single"/>
				</textElement>
				<text><![CDATA[Telah mendapatkan edukasi/informasi terkait pulang paksa/APS]]></text>
			</staticText>
			<staticText>
				<reportElement x="70" y="301" width="463" height="19" uuid="29640f3e-1d79-422e-9d21-107649d4ff3f">
					<property name="com.jaspersoft.studio.unit.height" value="px"/>
				</reportElement>
				<textElement textAlignment="Justified" verticalAlignment="Top">
					<font fontName="Tahoma" size="9" isItalic="true"/>
					<paragraph lineSpacing="Single"/>
				</textElement>
				<text><![CDATA[The education/information was provided when the patient/family was in a healthy, conscious, and calm condition.]]></text>
			</staticText>
			<staticText>
				<reportElement x="70" y="288" width="463" height="15" uuid="498e845c-08a7-4703-aded-2fce25ff5a34">
					<property name="com.jaspersoft.studio.unit.height" value="px"/>
				</reportElement>
				<textElement textAlignment="Justified" verticalAlignment="Top">
					<font fontName="Tahoma" size="9"/>
					<paragraph lineSpacing="Single"/>
				</textElement>
				<text><![CDATA[Mendapatkan edukasi/informasi dalam keadaan sehat, sadar, tidak panik]]></text>
			</staticText>
			<staticText>
				<reportElement x="35" y="87" width="20" height="20" uuid="a7046370-676a-4f83-a422-737132a9b777">
